 "insight": [
  "Luxembourg's exports to China have increased since 2015.",
  "The exports grew from 212.2 million euros in 2015 to 231.8 million euros in 2025.",
  "The highest export value was reached in 2022, with 242.5 million euros.",
  "This shows a 9.3% increase in exports over the ten-year period.",
  "The data are in current euros and do not account for inflation or price changes."
